      "content": "i get that but like i already know my kidneys are bad so i'm being careful. i just really dont want to wait days for an appointment. i checked online and most people say 100mg is a standard dose. if i just do it for like 3 days would that be okay? or is there something else i can take like just a high dose of vitamin C or something to help clear it out safely instead of the antibiotics?",
